    description: "**False positive (found while measuring WI-hizon on branch jgstern-agent/fix/fovus).** graphql_resolver's JS scanner mints a resolver symbol named after a control-flow keyword: `if (cond) {` inside a scope it reads as a `Query: { ... }` resolver map becomes `Query.if:function`, with a `references` edge to the `Query` SDL type.\n\nObserved on apollo-server (survey, branch head): 13 `Query.if:function` nodes in `.ts` files before the branch (`packages/integration-testsuite/src/apolloServerTests.ts` lines 2407, 2413, 2439, 2489, 2498, 2513, 2649, 2669, 2823, 3125; `httpServerTests.ts` 2065, 2443, 2647), plus 1 new one the branch exposes by now scanning `.cjs` (`smoke-test/smoke-test.cjs:57`, the line `if (process.env.INCREMENTAL_DELIVERY_TESTS_ENABLED) {`). Not checked: other keywords (`for`, `while`, `switch`, `catch`) and other repos.\n\nFix direction: exclude JS reserved words from the resolver-name capture (and check how the scanner decides it is still inside the resolver map)."  # 51ca
    fields: {}  # 51ca
