  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. graphql_resolver.py patterns (~:102-125) are unchanged since filing (later commits are activation/extension-list only). Fixture: a Query resolver map whose hello body has if/for/while/switch, in both .ts and .cjs, mints Query.if, Query.for, Query.while and Query.switch:function nodes (graphql-resolver-linker) in both files, besides the correct Query.hello. The premise holds and is wider than filed: every keyword followed by `(...) {` matches, not just `if`. MECHANISM: JS_FIELD_RESOLVER_SHORTHAND_PATTERN ^\\s*(async\\s+)?(\\w+)\\s*\\([^)]*\\)\\s*\\{ matches keyword statements, and the scanner does not track nesting depth inside the type object. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: none."  # aee1
